;. /save_grove_draft_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition save_grove_draft
  ;= Revise and compile an existing Grove draft
    Bind before to the retained own-record capture used to select Save and compile
    draft. Keep it separate from the live capture used to observe the result.
    The proposed source can come from grove_source or an explicitly authored value.
    Compilation failure leaves the native draft editable and the old attempts intact.
    This flow returns native values; use retain_result or compose project_result.

    ;@ /flow/input before
    ;= Exact draft revision selected for editing
    ;@ /flow/input proposal
    ;= Proposed complete Grove source
    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= Selected native Save and compile draft control
    ;@ /flow/input capture
    ;= Observation of the resulting draft job

    ;@ /flow/step actions ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/prepare_save
    ;@ /flow/bind before before
    ;@ /flow/bind proposal proposal
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;= Prepare against the selected revision
    ;@ /flow/invoke receipts ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/invoke_action_flow/flows/invoke_action
    ;@ /flow/bind actions actions
    ;= Save through native admission
    ;@ /flow/invoke verified ;/0x11/app/nenex/w/inspect_grove_draft_flow/flows/inspect_grove_draft
    ;@ /flow/bind capture capture
    ;@ /flow/bind proposal proposal
    ;@ /flow/bind receipts receipts
    ;= Check the actual compiled revision
    ;@ /flow/result verified
    ;= Verified native draft
